WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Turn one customer question into a brief someone can actually use.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.833
Write down the audience, the action they need to take, and your decision.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:14.708
Our fictional shop is deciding whether to test a clearer booking link for mobile visitors.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:19.167
Write your brief in one sentence. Check that it names one decision.
